hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2821","###\n Narrated to us by Abd al-Jabbar ibn al-Ala', who said: Narrated to us by Sufyan, from Zakariya, who said: I heard Al-Sha'bi say: I heard Urwa ibn Mudarris say: \"I was the first of the pilgrims to arrive. I came to the Prophet (ﷺ) while he was at Muzdalifah. He went out to pray when the dawn light appeared. I said: 'O Messenger of Allah, I have come to you from the mountain of"
